sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as React app
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login (E02)
  API->>DB: Load user, verify password hash
  API->>DB: INSERT refresh_token (hash, family_id)
  API-->>UI: 200 access JWT (15 min) + refresh token
  Note over UI: Access token kept in memory
  UI->>API: GET /api/v1/... Bearer access
  API-->>UI: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED (expired)
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (E03)
  API->>DB: Look up hash, check not used or revoked
  alt valid
    API->>DB: Mark used, INSERT rotated token (same family)
    API-->>UI: 200 new access + new refresh
    UI->>API: Retry original request
  else replayed (REFRESH_REUSED)
    API->>DB: Revoke whole family
    API-->>UI: 401 REFRESH_REUSED
    UI->>UI: Clear state, go to Login
  end
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout (E04)
  API->>DB: Revoke token family
  API-->>UI: 204
